  "prefLabel": "En 802.08 Hand digging",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 802.08 \"Hand digging\" means any excavation involving non-mechanized tools or equipment and includes, but is not limited to, digging with shovels, picks, probing bars, and manual post hole diggers.\n\nSource. #14062, eff 8-21-24",
